  "translation": "Yesterday was the weekend. My mom and I went to the market together. The market had many people inside. We first went to the fruit stall. Mom asked me: \"What do you want to eat?\" I said: \"I want to eat apples.\" Mom bought three apples. Then we went to the vegetable area. There were cabbage, radish, and tomatoes. We bought a few tomatoes. Mom also asked: \"Do you need anything else?\" I said: \"No, I don't need anything.\" Finally we went home."
